flowchart TD
    Context["Đọc AGENTS + current context"]
    Live["Scan live Fabric / SQL metadata"]
    Sync["Sync mart SQL + DQ/catalog packages"]
    Build["Build SQLPROJ package"]
    Manifest["Update manifest / wrapper contract"]
    Validate["Dry-run / compile / DQ / semantic smoke"]
    Handoff["Chuẩn bị scheduler / BOB handoff"]
    Log["Update context + docs"]

    Context --> Live --> Sync --> Build --> Manifest --> Validate --> Handoff --> Log
    Log --> Context
